  "title": "The Woman Downstairs",
  "subtitle": "\"I knew my husband was having an affair. I knew who with. What I did not know was that she was planning my murder, and that by the time I figured it out, I would be downstairs in her basement.\"",
  "penName": "Sylvia Crane",
  "genre": "mysteryThriller",
  "hook": "My husband Jamie had been having an affair with Dana Kaminski since February. I knew because I had read his phone. I had a plan. It was a simple, legal, humiliating plan — I was going to leave him with a divorce that took his condo, his practice, and the Tesla. On a Wednesday in July I drove to Dana's house to tell her face to face. She offered me a glass of wine. I accepted. By the time I understood what was in the wine, I was on her basement floor. The plan was no longer mine.",
